fortran/snow17_shim.f90 links directly against the unmodified FORTRAN-77
physics files in external/snow17/src/snow19/ (vendored as a git submodule,
pinned to a specific commit -- see external/snow17's own commit hash for
the exact version and its known issues). No changes were made to any
snow19/ source file; the shim only adds a bind(C) driver loop around
EXSNOW19.

See https://github.com/NOAA-OWP/snow17/blob/main/LICENSE for the full
upstream license text.
